#: upses.php
msgid "The Name you would like to give this UPS.  For APCUPSD and NUT Devices, a corresponding Cacti Device will be created automatically for the UPS using this name.  For SNMP based UPS's, you must create the Cacti Device first."
msgstr "Jina ambalo ungependa kuipa UPS hii.  Kwa Vifaa vya APCUPSD na NUT, Kifaa kinacholingana cha Cacti kitaundwa kiotomatiki kwa UPS kwa kutumia jina hili.  Kwa UPS zinazotegemea SNMP, lazima uunde Kifaa cha Cacti kwanza."

#: upses.php
msgid "New UPS"
msgstr "UPS Mpya"

#: upses.php
msgid "UPS Description"
msgstr "Maelezo ya UPS"

#: upses.php
msgid "A more detailed Description of this UPS if required."
msgstr "Maelezo ya kina zaidi ya UPS hii ikihitajika."

#: upses.php
msgid "UPS Type"
msgstr "Aina ya UPS"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Type of UPS you are monitoring."
msgstr "Aina ya UPS unayofuatilia."

#: upses.php
msgid "Poller ID"
msgstr "Kitambulisho cha Poller"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Poller that this UPS exists in is monitored by"
msgstr "Poller ambayo UPS hii ipo na inafuatiliwa nayo"

#: upses.php
msgid "Site Name"
msgstr "Jina la Eneo"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Site that this UPS exists in."
msgstr "Eneo ambamo UPS hii ipo."

#: upses.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Hakuna"

#: upses.php
msgid "Location"
msgstr "Mahali"

#: upses.php
msgid "The physical location of the Device.  This free form text can be a room, rack location, etc."
msgstr "Mahali halisi pa Kifaa.  Maandishi haya huru yanaweza kuwa chumba, mahali pa raki, n.k."

#: upses.php
msgid "Cacti Device"
msgstr "Kifaa cha Cacti"

#: upses.php
msgid "For SNMP Based UPS', select the Cacti Device to use for SNMP credentials.  Otherwise, select None, and the UPS plugin will create the Device for you automatically."
msgstr "Kwa UPS zinazotegemea SNMP, chagua Kifaa cha Cacti cha kutumia kwa vitambulisho vya SNMP.  Vinginevyo, chagua Hakuna, na programu-jalizi ya UPS itakuundia Kifaa kiotomatiki."

#: upses.php
msgid "Autocreate on First Poll"
msgstr "Unda Kiotomatiki kwenye Ukusanyaji wa Kwanza"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Imewezeshwa"

#: upses.php
msgid "Check to immediately start polling for data."
msgstr "Weka tiki ili kuanza kukusanya data mara moja."

#: upses.php
msgid "APC UPSD Information"
msgstr "Maelezo ya APC UPSD"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname of the host running apcupsd or the NUT server (upsd)."
msgstr "Jina la seva pangishi linaloendesha apcupsd au seva ya NUT (upsd)."

#: upses.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "Mlango wa TCP"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enter the TCP Port for this UPS.  apcupsd defaults to 3551 and NUT defaults to 3493."
msgstr "Weka Mlango wa TCP kwa UPS hii.  Chaguo-msingi la apcupsd ni 3551 na chaguo-msingi la NUT ni 3493."

#: upses.php
msgid "Timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "Muda wa kuisha (sekunde)"

#: upses.php
msgid "How long the poller waits for apcupsd or the NUT server before giving up on this UPS, from 1 to 120 seconds.  SNMP based UPS's use the SNMP timeout instead."
msgstr "Muda ambao poller husubiri apcupsd au seva ya NUT kabla ya kukata tamaa kwa UPS hii, kuanzia sekunde 1 hadi 120.  UPS zinazotegemea SNMP hutumia muda wa kuisha wa SNMP badala yake."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT UPS Name"
msgstr "Jina la UPS ya NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The name of the UPS on the NUT server, as listed by \"upsc -l\" (the part before the @ in ups@host).  One NUT server can serve several UPSes."
msgstr "Jina la UPS kwenye seva ya NUT, kama ilivyoorodheshwa na \"upsc -l\" (sehemu kabla ya @ katika ups@host).  Seva moja ya NUT inaweza kuhudumia UPS kadhaa."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Username"
msgstr "Jina la Mtumiaji wa NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The upsd.users account to authenticate with.  Leave blank for anonymous read-only access, which is how NUT servers are usually monitored."
msgstr "Si lazima.  Akaunti ya upsd.users ya kuthibitisha nayo.  Acha wazi kwa ufikiaji wa kusoma pekee bila jina, ambao ndio jinsi seva za NUT hufuatiliwa kwa kawaida."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Password"
msgstr "Nenosiri la NUT"

#: upses.php
msgid "The password for the NUT Username."
msgstr "Nenosiri la Jina la Mtumiaji wa NUT."

#: upses.php
msgid "Use TLS (STARTTLS)"
msgstr "Tumia TLS (STARTTLS)"

#: upses.php
msgid "Encrypt the connection with STARTTLS before any credentials are sent.  The NUT server certificate and host name are verified, so the certificate must be trusted by the Cacti poller, or you can point to its CA / certificate file below."
msgstr "Simba muunganisho kwa njia fiche ukitumia STARTTLS kabla ya vitambulisho vyovyote kutumwa.  Cheti cha seva ya NUT na jina la seva pangishi huthibitishwa, kwa hivyo cheti lazima kiaminiwe na poller ya Cacti, au unaweza kuelekeza kwenye faili yake ya CA / cheti hapa chini."

#: upses.php
msgid "CA / Certificate File"
msgstr "Faili ya CA / Cheti"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The full path on the Cacti poller to a PEM file holding the CA certificate (or the self-signed server certificate) to verify the NUT server against, for example /etc/nut/upsd.pem.  The host name above must match the certificate."
msgstr "Si lazima.  Njia kamili kwenye poller ya Cacti kwenda kwenye faili ya PEM iliyo na cheti cha CA (au cheti cha seva kilichojiwekea sahihi) ili kuthibitisha seva ya NUT, kwa mfano /etc/nut/upsd.pem.  Jina la seva pangishi hapo juu lazima lilingane na cheti."

#: upses.php
msgid "Allow Self-Signed Certificate"
msgstr "Ruhusu Cheti Kilichojiwekea Sahihi"

#: upses.php
msgid "Accept any certificate without checking it.  The connection is still encrypted, but the NUT server is not authenticated, so a man-in-the-middle could read the NUT credentials.  Prefer the CA / Certificate File above."
msgstr "Kubali cheti chochote bila kukikagua.  Muunganisho bado umesimbwa kwa njia fiche, lakini seva ya NUT haijathibitishwa, kwa hivyo mtu wa kati anaweza kusoma vitambulisho vya NUT.  Pendekeza kutumia Faili ya CA / Cheti hapo juu."

#: upses.php
msgid "SNMP Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za SNMP"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname where the snmp agent is located."
msgstr "Jina la seva pangishi ambapo wakala wa snmp yupo."

#: upses.php
msgid "The Poller ID cannot be changed while the UPS is linked to a Cacti Device.  Change the poller on the device instead."
msgstr "Kitambulisho cha Poller hakiwezi kubadilishwa wakati UPS imeunganishwa na Kifaa cha Cacti.  Badilisha poller kwenye kifaa badala yake."

#: upses.php
msgid "Template UPS was not found! Unable to duplicate."
msgstr "Kiolezo cha UPS hakikupatikana! Haiwezekani kunakili."

#: upses.php
msgid "None of the selected UPSes has a Cacti Device yet, so Graph Automation was not run.  A device is created on the first successful poll."
msgstr "Hakuna UPS yoyote iliyochaguliwa ambayo ina Kifaa cha Cacti bado, kwa hivyo Uotomatishaji wa Grafu haukuendeshwa.  Kifaa huundwa kwenye ukusanyaji wa kwanza uliofanikiwa."

#: upses.php
#, php-format
msgid "Graph Automation was run for %d UPS(es).  %d UPS(es) have no Cacti Device yet and were skipped."
msgstr "Uotomatishaji wa Grafu uliendeshwa kwa UPS %d.  UPS %d hazina Kifaa cha Cacti bado na zilirukwa."

