msgid_plural "Click 'Continue' to run Graph Automation for the following UPSes.  Graphs, data sources and tree items are created from each device's templates and the matching automation rules; graphs that already exist are left as they are.  Only a UPS that already has a Cacti Device is affected."
msgstr[0] "Bofya 'Endelea' ili kuendesha Otomatiki ya Grafu kwa UPS ifuatayo.  Grafu, vyanzo vya data na vipengee vya mti huundwa kutoka kwa violezo vya kifaa na kanuni zinazolingana za otomatiki; grafu ambazo tayari zipo huachwa zilivyo.  Ni UPS ambayo tayari ina Kifaa cha Cacti pekee ndiyo itaathiriwa."
msgstr[1] "Bofya 'Endelea' ili kuendesha Otomatiki ya Grafu kwa UPS zifuatazo.  Grafu, vyanzo vya data na vipengee vya mti huundwa kutoka kwa violezo vya kila kifaa na kanuni zinazolingana za otomatiki; grafu ambazo tayari zipo huachwa zilivyo.  Ni UPS ambayo tayari ina Kifaa cha Cacti pekee ndiyo itaathiriwa."

